sequenceDiagram
    participant C as CanvasElement
    participant T as LineTool
    participant D as Document
    participant H as CommandHistory
    participant S as Scene

    Note over C: MouseDown（取得 mouse capture）
    C->>T: onMouseDown
    T->>T: beginDraft()
    T-->>C: ToolResult：重畫
    loop 拖曳中
        C->>T: onMouseMove
        T->>T: 更新 Draft 終點
        T-->>C: ToolResult：重畫（Draft 畫在 Scene 上方）
    end
    Note over C: MouseUp
    C->>T: onMouseUp
    T->>T: commitDraft()
    T-->>C: ToolResult：AddObjectAction
    C->>D: addObject(line)
    D->>H: execute(AddObjectCommand)
    H->>S: AddObjectCommand.execute()<br/>→ add(line)
    H->>H: 推入 undo 堆疊，清空 redo 堆疊
    C->>C: invalidateDisplay()
